{"id":"sl/y90nupkv","index":0,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"把电子书变成多角色有声书","elements":[{"id":"sh/ts7md4r2","kind":"textbox","text":"把电子书变成多角色有声书","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/547294r6","kind":"textbox","text":"01","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/k3yl0zql","kind":"textbox","text":"我们做了什么，怎样做成","position":{"left":64,"top":205,"width":1110,"height":105}},{"id":"sh/7qp4be9c","kind":"textbox","text":"给不同人物安排声音\n找出读错的地方，尽量只修有问题的部分","position":{"left":68,"top":365,"width":1100,"height":128}},{"id":"sh/65g3298r","kind":"textbox","text":"项目进展与改进思路    2026 年 10 月 18 日","position":{"left":68,"top":569,"width":1100,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/hwbqtkby","index":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"这个项目能帮我们做什么","elements":[{"id":"im/lczil8jm","kind":"image","position":{"left":64,"top":177.56,"width":730,"height":410.88}},{"id":"sh/b29kza94","kind":"textbox","text":"这个项目能帮我们做什么","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/a10jqpsj","kind":"textbox","text":"02","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/x4r21kru","kind":"textbox","text":"把书读成有声书","position":{"left":835,"top":184,"width":380,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/w3i1sfa9","kind":"textbox","text":"上传电子书、选择章节，\n让旁白和不同人物分别朗读。","position":{"left":835,"top":233,"width":380,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/r65knqtk","kind":"textbox","text":"读错一小段，就修这一段","position":{"left":835,"top":390,"width":380,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/q5wjelsz","kind":"textbox","text":"找到多读、漏读或停顿过长\n的位置，尽量少重做整章。","position":{"left":835,"top":439,"width":380,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/ove9o7yd","kind":"textbox","text":"左图是 10 月 12 日的实际界面，后续新增功能用流程图说明","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/ofy9wn61","index":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"目前已经做成了哪些功能","elements":[{"id":"sh/3ah8rqlg","kind":"textbox","text":"目前已经做成了哪些功能","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/cza94vmx","kind":"textbox","text":"03","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/szqpkfyx","kind":"table","text":"制作步骤\t已经能做什么\t目前的情况\n读入书籍\t提取章节，整理人物和人物别名\t支持中英文，允许人工修改\n安排声音\t选现成声音、用文字描述、模仿参考音\t已选好的声音可以锁定\n生成音频\t逐段生成，保存结果，按顺序拼起来\t新的整套流程目前接入 MiMo\n检查与修正\t找读错、长停顿、换声等疑点\t已完成部分实际问题的修正\n网页操作\t选章节、确认配置、查看和下载结果\t后台流程已做测试","position":{"left":64,"top":175,"width":1152,"height":400}},{"id":"sh/298ryl4v","kind":"textbox","text":"原来的转换器仍支持多种语音服务，本轮重点做好 MiMo 的整套制作流程","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/jyx0ra1s","index":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"从上传书籍到下载音频，具体怎么走","elements":[{"id":"sh/gv29g7q5","kind":"shape","position":{"left":912,"top":520,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/1wbapc7q","kind":"shape","position":{"left":608,"top":520,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/2xkrih8b","kind":"shape","position":{"left":304,"top":520,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/3ytsrmpw","kind":"shape","position":{"left":184,"top":425,"width":0,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/oz29krqh","kind":"shape","position":{"left":304,"top":373,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/p0batw72","kind":"shape","position":{"left":608,"top":373,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/h4fa9wfy","kind":"shape","position":{"left":912,"top":373,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/g36tgryd","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1096,"top":278,"width":0,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/v6tsv2xo","kind":"shape","position":{"left":912,"top":226,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/a5kr2xg3","kind":"shape","position":{"left":608,"top":226,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/x8vaxsfe","kind":"shape","position":{"left":304,"top":226,"width":64,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/et0reh8f","kind":"textbox","text":"从上传书籍到下载音频，具体怎么走","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/1cj2d8b6","kind":"textbox","text":"04","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/0ba143al","kind":"textbox","text":"1 上传书籍\n选择要朗读的章节","position":{"left":64,"top":174,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/rm1k7yt4","kind":"textbox","text":"2 找出说话的人\n谁在讲故事或说话","position":{"left":368,"top":174,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/ql8jytsj","kind":"textbox","text":"3 对照书中原文\n核对是否漏字、改字","position":{"left":672,"top":174,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/doj29oba","kind":"textbox","text":"4 选声音并确认\n试听声音，设置语速","position":{"left":976,"top":174,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/sna103ap","kind":"textbox","text":"5 整理实际读法\n处理数字、缩写读法","position":{"left":976,"top":321,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/3ihk3et8","kind":"textbox","text":"6 按句分成小段\n记录人物和停顿","position":{"left":672,"top":321,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/ih8ju9sn","kind":"textbox","text":"7 逐段生成并保存\nMiMo 生成，可复用","position":{"left":368,"top":321,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/kbm987y5","kind":"textbox","text":"8 找出可疑问题\n查漏读、重复和停顿","position":{"left":64,"top":321,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/5cva1cfq","kind":"textbox","text":"9 只修有问题的段\n剪多余内容或重读","position":{"left":64,"top":468,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/i94r6xgz","kind":"textbox","text":"10 再查前后两句\n更好才保留新版","position":{"left":368,"top":468,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/jadsz2xk","kind":"textbox","text":"11 拼成整章音频\n检查整章能否播放","position":{"left":672,"top":468,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/w72947yt","kind":"textbox","text":"12 试听确认并下载\n保留问题单和原音","position":{"left":976,"top":468,"width":240,"height":104}},{"id":"sh/fu9sn2p0","kind":"textbox","text":"修复有次数和用时限制，拿不准的问题留给人工试听，不会当作已经通过","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/i107q5of","index":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"三个创新方向，分别解决什么问题","elements":[{"id":"sh/l4bupwny","kind":"textbox","text":"三个创新方向，分别解决什么问题","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/dgbulwnm","kind":"textbox","text":"05","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/l8vmh8b2","kind":"table","text":"改进方向\t项目中遇到的具体问题\t我们的做法\n谁讲故事，\n就用谁的声音\t《Flipped》人物用“我”讲故事，\n部分文字曾被分给普通旁白\t按本章原文找出讲述者，\n让自述与本人对白共用声音\n经常对话的人，\n声音尽量不同\t试用的合格英语声音只有两个，\n给旁白留一个后，角色声音不够\t常对话的人优先用不同声音，\n不够时用固定描述补充\n哪里读错，\n就优先修哪里\tR039 读完又重复，\nJ076 两句话之间停得太久\t只处理问题段，\n再检查前后句有没有受影响","position":{"left":64,"top":180,"width":1152,"height":354}},{"id":"sh/z2tcnm5s","kind":"textbox","text":"共同目标：少弄错说话的人，少重复生成，少让人反复试听","position":{"left":64,"top":561,"width":1150,"height":56}},{"id":"sh/yhkbe1o7","kind":"textbox","text":"已有文字归属修正和音频修复案例，声音分配是否更好认仍需听众比较","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/x8f69ofe","index":5,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"创新一：谁讲故事，就用谁的声音","elements":[{"id":"sh/h4bupgn6","kind":"textbox","text":"创新一：谁讲故事，就用谁的声音","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/yhg7epsj","kind":"textbox","text":"06","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/zi98nu94","kind":"textbox","text":"具体问题","position":{"left":64,"top":170,"width":1120,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/87ipkzal","kind":"textbox","text":"《Flipped》的两章分别由 Bryce 和 Juli 用“我”讲述。\n早期拆分时，有些人物自述被当成了普通旁白。","position":{"left":64,"top":219,"width":1120,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/98rqt4r6","kind":"textbox","text":"Bryce 讲故事\n沿用 Bryce 的声音","position":{"left":64,"top":360,"width":330,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/ml07i9sv","kind":"textbox","text":"Juli 讲故事\n沿用 Juli 的声音","position":{"left":480,"top":360,"width":330,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/7m98ru9g","kind":"textbox","text":"换一章，\n重新判断是谁在讲","position":{"left":890,"top":377,"width":310,"height":90}},{"id":"sh/oryp8fah","kind":"textbox","text":"已完成：两章的文字分配已修正，自述和本人对白共用声音配置。","position":{"left":64,"top":525,"width":1140,"height":68}},{"id":"sh/pc76hkr2","kind":"textbox","text":"这次检查确认的是文字和声音的分配，没有为这两章重新生成语音","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/gnmp4jqx","index":6,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"怎么做到：每一句都能回到书中核对","elements":[{"id":"sh/l0vuh0rm","kind":"shape","position":{"left":785,"top":242,"width":141,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/kzmdova1","kind":"shape","position":{"left":354,"top":242,"width":141,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/xcz2l03q","kind":"textbox","text":"怎么做到：每一句都能回到书中核对","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/cb2tkvap","kind":"textbox","text":"07","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/dcbud0ra","kind":"textbox","text":"模型先判断\n这句是谁在说","position":{"left":64,"top":194,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/ydkbm5sv","kind":"textbox","text":"程序对照原文\n检查有没有漏字或改字","position":{"left":495,"top":194,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/zedcfa9g","kind":"textbox","text":"找到人物后\n使用已保存的声音","position":{"left":926,"top":194,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/eh0ba1sr","kind":"textbox","text":"每一段都记住它在原书中的位置","position":{"left":64,"top":359,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/fi9c369c","kind":"textbox","text":"把所有小段拼回去，要能对应完整章节。\n判断讲述者时，还要留下书里的原句，让人能检查理由。","position":{"left":64,"top":408,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/baxkjqlk","kind":"textbox","text":"找不到可靠依据时，先用普通旁白，并标出“需要复核”。","position":{"left":64,"top":538,"width":1140,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/a9ojq5kz","kind":"textbox","text":"程序可以检查有没有漏字，但“到底是谁在说”仍可能需要人来确认","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/fu1gfa1s","index":7,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"书上怎么写，实际怎么读","elements":[{"id":"sh/tkby9kzm","kind":"textbox","text":"书上怎么写，实际怎么读","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/18byd4zy","kind":"textbox","text":"08","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/d4nu5ozq","kind":"table","text":"书上写的内容\t可以怎样处理\t为什么这样做\n增长 3.5%\t读成“增长百分之三点五”\t让朗读更自然，保留原文不动\n20 books / twenty books\t检查时允许这两种写法对应\t避免把数字写法差异当成读错\nC’mon\t本次修复改用 Come on! 朗读\t解决 R034 一个词开头反复读的问题\n人名、编号、多音字\t拿不准就保留，交给人试听\t避免程序擅自改出新错误","position":{"left":64,"top":182,"width":1152,"height":347}},{"id":"sh/ri9g7uhw","kind":"textbox","text":"书籍原文和“发给语音服务的读法”分开保存，修改有记录。","position":{"left":64,"top":563,"width":1145,"height":56}},{"id":"sh/6h0fypgb","kind":"textbox","text":"录音转成的文字相同，也不能证明多音字读对了，最终还要听声音","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/udsvah03","index":8,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"创新二：经常对话的人，声音尽量不同","elements":[{"id":"sh/ah8nu54b","kind":"shape","position":{"left":800,"top":416,"width":96,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/bih4na5w","kind":"shape","position":{"left":384,"top":416,"width":96,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/2xsjepgb","kind":"textbox","text":"创新二：经常对话的人，声音尽量不同","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/1cfmhgne","kind":"textbox","text":"09","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/0b65obm9","kind":"textbox","text":"具体问题","position":{"left":64,"top":170,"width":1120,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/nex4jq5k","kind":"textbox","text":"试用的英语声音库里，经过试听确认的现成声音只有 Mia 和 Chloe。\n旁白占用一个后，就很难给其他人物各分一种声音。","position":{"left":64,"top":219,"width":1120,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/mdonql4z","kind":"textbox","text":"对白多的角色\n优先选现成声音","position":{"left":64,"top":365,"width":320,"height":102}},{"id":"sh/9gzml0nq","kind":"textbox","text":"其他角色\n用固定文字描述声音","position":{"left":480,"top":365,"width":320,"height":102}},{"id":"sh/ofq5svm5","kind":"textbox","text":"经常互相说话的人\n优先拉开声音差别","position":{"left":896,"top":365,"width":320,"height":102}},{"id":"sh/oza1gfyh","kind":"textbox","text":"实际试用：用文字设定两个角色的声音，六条录音经试听确认容易区分。","position":{"left":64,"top":529,"width":1140,"height":70}},{"id":"sh/p0ji9kf2","kind":"textbox","text":"这里只确认了这两个角色的录音，还不能说自动分配一定比随机分配更好","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/m90b6t0r","index":9,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"怎么做到：先让不同声音读同样的句子","elements":[{"id":"sh/kzu5c32t","kind":"shape","position":{"left":785,"top":235,"width":141,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/l036l83y","kind":"shape","position":{"left":354,"top":235,"width":141,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/r6pcv6lw","kind":"textbox","text":"怎么做到：先让不同声音读同样的句子","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/xc3mho32","kind":"textbox","text":"10","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/cbu58j2h","kind":"textbox","text":"准备相同的试听句\n每种声音至少读两句","position":{"left":64,"top":187,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/zelojyl8","kind":"textbox","text":"先听内容是否完整\n再记录声音特点","position":{"left":495,"top":187,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/ydcnatkn","kind":"textbox","text":"比较不同声音\n是否容易听成同一个人","position":{"left":926,"top":187,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/725onyl4","kind":"textbox","text":"为什么要读相同的句子","position":{"left":64,"top":347,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/m1cnetkj","kind":"textbox","text":"如果一个声音读问句，另一个读感叹句，差别可能来自语气。\n让它们读同样的内容，比较才更公平。","position":{"left":64,"top":396,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/s7yt4b21","kind":"textbox","text":"电脑怎么参与比较","position":{"left":64,"top":493,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/d87uxg3m","kind":"textbox","text":"程序把声音特点记成一组数字，比较它们有多相似。\n换几句话再比，避免只凭一句话就认定两种声音不同。","position":{"left":64,"top":542,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/q5gb21kb","kind":"textbox","text":"电脑给出的相似程度只是参考，最终要请听众判断能不能认出人物","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/jetc3ut0","index":10,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"怎么做到：把声音优先分给最需要区分的人","elements":[{"id":"sh/ofqtgnyt","kind":"textbox","text":"怎么做到：把声音优先分给最需要区分的人","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/xcryxg7y","kind":"textbox","text":"11","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/wbih4b6d","kind":"textbox","text":"先看哪些人物经常一来一回地说话","position":{"left":64,"top":173,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/n69grmpw","kind":"textbox","text":"程序按原文统计两个人轮流说话的次数。\n对话越频繁，越优先给他们安排差别较大的声音。","position":{"left":64,"top":222,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/250zy18b","kind":"textbox","text":"同时保留用户的选择","position":{"left":64,"top":327,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/98rytw72","kind":"textbox","text":"已经锁定的声音不会被自动改掉。\n也可以要求旁白单独用一种声音，或不同人物不共用声音。","position":{"left":64,"top":376,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/o7ih0r6h","kind":"textbox","text":"方案少就逐个比较，方案多就先做好主要人物","position":{"left":64,"top":481,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/72t03qp0","kind":"textbox","text":"先给经常说话的人分配，再尝试交换声音，看看能不能更容易区分。\n还会考虑声音是否适合人物，尽量少改已经定好的安排。","position":{"left":64,"top":530,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/61kzalof","kind":"textbox","text":"这是当前程序的分配方法，是否真的更好听、更好认，需要专门做试听比较","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/8f2psfyx","index":11,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"现在可以怎样给人物安排声音","elements":[{"id":"sh/b6d4f2lc","kind":"shape","position":{"left":790,"top":577.5,"width":102,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/sb2lcnmd","kind":"shape","position":{"left":388,"top":577.5,"width":102,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/wvupgz6t","kind":"textbox","text":"现在可以怎样给人物安排声音","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/1gbm9s3a","kind":"textbox","text":"12","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/d8zytwbi","kind":"table","text":"方法\t用户要做什么\t项目中的具体例子\n选现成声音\t直接选择服务里已有的声音\tJuli 曾使用 Chloe\n用文字描述声音\t写清年龄感、音色和说话方式\t同学群体使用固定的声音描述\n模仿一段参考录音\t提供参考音，让服务照着声音来读\tBryce 先试读几句，再用于整章","position":{"left":64,"top":186,"width":1152,"height":310}},{"id":"sh/ra943il8","kind":"textbox","text":"每个人物保存一份\n声音设置","position":{"left":88,"top":545,"width":300,"height":65}},{"id":"sh/q903ad4n","kind":"textbox","text":"换章时继续使用\n同一份设置","position":{"left":490,"top":545,"width":300,"height":65}},{"id":"sh/dcbm583y","kind":"textbox","text":"声音换过之后\n重新试听确认","position":{"left":892,"top":545,"width":300,"height":65}},{"id":"sh/a543mx4r","kind":"textbox","text":"模仿参考音通常称为“声音克隆”，换过声音后的录音不能沿用旧试听结论","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/hgzapcr6","index":12,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"生成之后，重点检查哪几类问题","elements":[{"id":"sh/p4r6p8by","kind":"textbox","text":"生成之后，重点检查哪几类问题","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/q50nydsj","kind":"textbox","text":"13","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/qx4vmdcz","kind":"table","text":"要检查什么\t程序怎样找疑点\t人还需要注意什么\n有没有读错\t把录音转成文字，再与原文比较\t文字可能识别错，不能直接删声音\n两段连得顺不顺\t查看句尾句首、音量和停顿\t爆音、卡顿和长停顿需要试听\n人物声音变没变\t与该人物已确认的录音比较\t情绪变化也会让声音听起来不同\n文件是否正常\t检查过响、长时间无声及能否播放\t文件能播放，不等于每句话都合格","position":{"left":64,"top":183,"width":1152,"height":370}},{"id":"sh/o3i5w3ad","kind":"textbox","text":"每项分别标记“通过”“有问题”或“还没查清”，没查清不会自动算通过","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/6lsnupw7","index":13,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"怎么找到疑点：让电脑先帮我们听一遍","elements":[{"id":"sh/x4ni9ofy","kind":"shape","position":{"left":800,"top":554,"width":146,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/c3e1gjyd","kind":"shape","position":{"left":334,"top":554,"width":146,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/b2507exs","kind":"textbox","text":"怎么找到疑点：让电脑先帮我们听一遍","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/xc7eds76","kind":"textbox","text":"14","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/wbydknq1","kind":"textbox","text":"第一步，把录音变成文字","position":{"left":64,"top":171,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/jepwf2pc","kind":"textbox","text":"一字一词地与要读的内容比较，标出多读、漏读和读成别的词的位置。\n英文按词比较，中文按字比较。","position":{"left":64,"top":220,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/idgvmx8r","kind":"textbox","text":"第二步，与这个人物之前的声音比较","position":{"left":64,"top":328,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/5grehs7i","kind":"textbox","text":"看看声音、音调和速度有没有明显变化。\n句子太短或情绪变化太大时，先提示复核，不急着判断读错。","position":{"left":64,"top":377,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/kfidonqx","kind":"textbox","text":"前一句的结尾","position":{"left":64,"top":516,"width":270,"height":76}},{"id":"sh/zi5c3y98","kind":"textbox","text":"两句话连起来\n检查停顿和声音突变","position":{"left":480,"top":516,"width":320,"height":76}},{"id":"sh/ehwvat8n","kind":"textbox","text":"后一句的开头","position":{"left":946,"top":516,"width":270,"height":76}},{"id":"sh/a1wze9g7","kind":"textbox","text":"程序负责缩小试听范围，拿不准的地方保留录音和提示，让人最后决定","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/vaxsvy10","index":14,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"创新三：哪里读错，就优先修哪里","elements":[{"id":"sh/t87ml0ji","kind":"textbox","text":"创新三：哪里读错，就优先修哪里","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/547mhg3m","kind":"textbox","text":"15","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/lkji1or6","kind":"table","text":"首章中的实际问题\t这次怎样修\t解决了什么\nR039 正文读完后又重复\t留下完整正文，去掉后面的重复\t不用把整章再生成一遍\nJ076 两句之间停得太久\t去掉已确认的多余无声部分\t让连接处恢复到约 1 秒停顿\nR034 一个词开头读了几遍\t改用 Come on! 的读法重新生成\t只增加一次生成请求","position":{"left":64,"top":185,"width":1152,"height":310}},{"id":"sh/76p4jqls","kind":"textbox","text":"这几处都已做局部试听确认，原始录音仍然保留。","position":{"left":64,"top":543,"width":1140,"height":60}},{"id":"sh/65gnqlk7","kind":"textbox","text":"修复一个地方之后，还要听前后两句，防止修好这里、影响旁边","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/gny5sjyp","index":15,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"怎么控制重试：给制作过程设一个上限","elements":[{"id":"sh/ip4zel83","kind":"shape","position":{"left":785,"top":333,"width":141,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/lwbyxwra","kind":"shape","position":{"left":354,"top":333,"width":141,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/1ojy10ne","kind":"textbox","text":"怎么控制重试：给制作过程设一个上限","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/8z2h8bq1","kind":"textbox","text":"16","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/9kby1g7m","kind":"textbox","text":"事先设好：最多请求几次、修几次、补读多少字、用多长时间","position":{"left":64,"top":173,"width":1150,"height":64}},{"id":"sh/ytkf2h8j","kind":"textbox","text":"确实需要重新读\n只发送问题段","position":{"left":64,"top":285,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/zutgvm94","kind":"textbox","text":"先检查剩余额度\n登记这次尝试","position":{"left":495,"top":285,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/kv2h4rqp","kind":"textbox","text":"请求语音服务\n记录成功或失败","position":{"left":926,"top":285,"width":290,"height":96}},{"id":"sh/3qdg7qpo","kind":"textbox","text":"失败的一次也记下来","position":{"left":64,"top":440,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/fm1gzq5o","kind":"textbox","text":"避免网络或生成失败后反复重试，把次数悄悄用完。\n上限到了就停止追加，把仍未解决的问题列出来。","position":{"left":64,"top":489,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/e1sf65o3","kind":"textbox","text":"目前按次数、文字量和时间控制，尚未直接计算花了多少元","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/14bup87q","index":16,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"怎么判断修好了：新旧版本一起比较","elements":[{"id":"sh/snedsvml","kind":"shape","position":{"left":724,"top":216,"width":125,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/t8ne10n6","kind":"shape","position":{"left":299,"top":216,"width":125,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/3ap8fm50","kind":"textbox","text":"怎么判断修好了：新旧版本一起比较","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/1c7e50ni","kind":"textbox","text":"17","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/gbedwfmx","kind":"textbox","text":"前一句","position":{"left":64,"top":176,"width":235,"height":80}},{"id":"sh/rm5czq50","kind":"textbox","text":"修改后的这一句","position":{"left":424,"top":176,"width":300,"height":80}},{"id":"sh/6lwvql4v","kind":"textbox","text":"后一句","position":{"left":849,"top":176,"width":235,"height":80}},{"id":"sh/jilcvq54","kind":"textbox","text":"先看原来正确的部分有没有受影响","position":{"left":64,"top":320,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/ihcvml4j","kind":"textbox","text":"内容不能少读或多读，原来通过的检查还要继续通过。\n这一句和前后句的连接也要重新检查。","position":{"left":64,"top":369,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/4by9or6l","kind":"textbox","text":"再看这次修改有没有解决问题","position":{"left":64,"top":479,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/pc7qhwn6","kind":"textbox","text":"程序确认有改善，才采用新版本。没有改善就继续保留原件。\n像“声音是否适合人物”这样的问题，仍要靠人试听。","position":{"left":64,"top":528,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/29grm1of","kind":"textbox","text":"只修一个问题段，也要一起检查它的前后两句","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/y5wne50z","index":17,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"具体例子：读完又重复，怎样安全去掉","elements":[{"id":"sh/4felwzu5","kind":"shape","position":{"left":580,"top":549,"width":145,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/rip4retw","kind":"textbox","text":"具体例子：读完又重复，怎样安全去掉","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/wrelszu9","kind":"textbox","text":"18","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/cbe98ba9","kind":"table","text":"先确认什么\t然后怎样处理\n原文应该读的部分已经完整读完\t找正文与多余重复之间的停顿\n前半段内容完整，后半段只有多余重复\t把两部分分别转成文字，再次核对\n切的位置不会伤到正常发音\t两边留出 0.1 秒保护，只去掉多余尾段","position":{"left":64,"top":183,"width":1152,"height":270}},{"id":"sh/itw3upcf","kind":"textbox","text":"原文该读的部分\n完整保留","position":{"left":100,"top":507,"width":480,"height":84}},{"id":"sh/je5knut0","kind":"textbox","text":"多出来的重复\n确认后再去掉","position":{"left":725,"top":507,"width":350,"height":84}},{"id":"sh/5gnmp4bq","kind":"textbox","text":"停顿处切开","position":{"left":592,"top":466,"width":180,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/6hw3y9sb","kind":"textbox","text":"默认先让人复核，只有条件明确且用户开启自动处理时才自动采用","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/nid43ytk","index":18,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"原音和修改版都保存，随时能查清改了什么","elements":[{"id":"sh/wj2psvat","kind":"shape","position":{"left":790,"top":240,"width":126,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/xkbq10be","kind":"shape","position":{"left":364,"top":240,"width":126,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/qpgjex8f","kind":"textbox","text":"原音和修改版都保存，随时能查清改了什么","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/9gb6xgbi","kind":"textbox","text":"19","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/8v2pobax","kind":"textbox","text":"生成时\n记下正文和声音设置","position":{"left":64,"top":193,"width":300,"height":94}},{"id":"sh/vitozqt8","kind":"textbox","text":"生成后\n保存原始录音","position":{"left":490,"top":193,"width":300,"height":94}},{"id":"sh/ahk7qls3","kind":"textbox","text":"修改后\n另存新版本和修改记录","position":{"left":916,"top":193,"width":300,"height":94}},{"id":"sh/jmd83atk","kind":"textbox","text":"同样的内容和设置，可以复用已有录音","position":{"left":64,"top":359,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/il47u5sz","kind":"textbox","text":"调语速、剪重复等处理另存文件，原来的录音不会被覆盖。\n最后按顺序拼成整章，并检查音频和检查单是否对应。","position":{"left":64,"top":408,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/cri1gnql","kind":"textbox","text":"例如：R039 去掉多余重复后，仍能找到修改前的录音进行比较。","position":{"left":64,"top":544,"width":1150,"height":60}},{"id":"sh/dsri9sr6","kind":"textbox","text":"每份文件都有唯一校验记录，避免拿旧音频的试听结论套在新版本上","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/zyxsni5k","index":19,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"实际完成的案例：《Flipped》首章","elements":[{"id":"sh/qh4nupg7","kind":"textbox","text":"实际完成的案例：《Flipped》首章","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/qpwjmh8n","kind":"textbox","text":"20","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/rq50vmp8","kind":"textbox","text":"14,311","position":{"left":64,"top":191,"width":280,"height":90}},{"id":"sh/4nu1krqh","kind":"textbox","text":"原文字符","position":{"left":67,"top":294,"width":270,"height":45}},{"id":"sh/po3itc72","kind":"textbox","text":"5","position":{"left":364,"top":191,"width":280,"height":90}},{"id":"sh/2lczih8r","kind":"textbox","text":"人物与角色","position":{"left":367,"top":294,"width":270,"height":45}},{"id":"sh/3ml0rmpw","kind":"textbox","text":"100","position":{"left":664,"top":191,"width":280,"height":90}},{"id":"sh/gjuhg7ql","kind":"textbox","text":"生成的小段","position":{"left":667,"top":294,"width":270,"height":45}},{"id":"sh/hk3ipcr6","kind":"textbox","text":"99","position":{"left":964,"top":191,"width":280,"height":90}},{"id":"sh/dkfmp4zy","kind":"textbox","text":"小段连接处","position":{"left":967,"top":294,"width":270,"height":45}},{"id":"tb/jy1wvit0","kind":"table","text":"阶段\t已经做了什么\n首次生成\t完成约 15 分 32 秒的原始版本，保留原音频\n调整 Bryce 声音\t根据已确认的参考音，增加 67 次生成请求\n修正具体问题\t处理重复和长停顿等问题，最新版本约 17 分 34 秒","position":{"left":64,"top":393,"width":1152,"height":205}},{"id":"sh/rid4nuhs","kind":"textbox","text":"版本时长不同，不能直接说明谁更好，已确认的局部也不代表整章全部通过","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/m1wvqtk3","index":20,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"哪些问题已经试听确认修好了","elements":[{"id":"sh/dcb2t87y","kind":"textbox","text":"哪些问题已经试听确认修好了","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/1gbmxs7a","kind":"textbox","text":"21","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/50vypw3y","kind":"table","text":"问题位置\t做了什么修改\t已经确认的范围\nR039 句尾重复\t留下完整正文，删多余重复\t保留的正常语音没改，局部试听通过\nR018 多读 No\t只留下原文要求的三次 No\t前后片段已核对，局部试听通过\nJ076 停顿太长\t只剪掉多余的无声部分\t两句之间约 1 秒，试听通过\nR034 开头反复读\tC’mon 改用 Come on! 来读\t发音及与前后句的连接试听通过","position":{"left":64,"top":181,"width":1152,"height":350}},{"id":"sh/ra9kryp8","kind":"textbox","text":"已保存 10 个试听接受的修复案例，全部来自同一本书的同一章。","position":{"left":64,"top":559,"width":1150,"height":58}},{"id":"sh/qp03yt8n","kind":"textbox","text":"这些案例能说明具体怎么修，还不能算出对其他书籍的修复成功率","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/5onypobq","index":21,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"让人少重复听，接下来再验证人物好不好认","elements":[{"id":"sh/jmh8nyd0","kind":"shape","position":{"left":750,"top":228.5,"width":156,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/il87etcv","kind":"shape","position":{"left":329,"top":228.5,"width":156,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/2honyx8r","kind":"textbox","text":"让人少重复听，接下来再验证人物好不好认","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/6987itcr","kind":"textbox","text":"22","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/7a18rydc","kind":"textbox","text":"133 条问题提示","position":{"left":64,"top":186,"width":265,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/k7qpgjul","kind":"textbox","text":"整理为 48 个片段","position":{"left":485,"top":186,"width":265,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/58zqpov6","kind":"textbox","text":"合成 9 段试听内容","position":{"left":906,"top":186,"width":310,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/43u9snu5","kind":"textbox","text":"同一段录音被反复提示，就合在一起听","position":{"left":64,"top":326,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/p43q1sva","kind":"textbox","text":"每个问题都保留，只合并重复的试听范围。\n原来重叠片段加起来约 27 分钟，合并后约 16 分钟。","position":{"left":64,"top":375,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/p4z6tcri","kind":"textbox","text":"“听出是谁”的题目已经准备好","position":{"left":64,"top":482,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/436507qx","kind":"textbox","text":"36 道题，使用九段已做试听检查的录音。\n目前还没有听众答题结果，不能说自动分配已经更容易辨认。","position":{"left":64,"top":531,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/3ixor29c","kind":"textbox","text":"本批自动分配与随机分配恰好相同，不能用这批材料比较二者优劣","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/c7uhcr6t","index":22,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"网页操作保护：重新拆分后，要重新确认","elements":[{"id":"sh/ip4rqhgn","kind":"shape","position":{"left":907,"top":247,"width":69,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/jqd8jmhs","kind":"shape","position":{"left":603,"top":247,"width":69,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/w3m9o7yh","kind":"shape","position":{"left":299,"top":247,"width":69,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/0fi94jmx","kind":"textbox","text":"网页操作保护：重新拆分后，要重新确认","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/90vqdczq","kind":"textbox","text":"23","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"sh/8zm9k7y5","kind":"textbox","text":"上传书籍\n选择要做的章节","position":{"left":64,"top":200,"width":235,"height":94}},{"id":"sh/v2d8fmhw","kind":"textbox","text":"重新拆分文字\n旧的确认立即失效","position":{"left":368,"top":200,"width":235,"height":94}},{"id":"sh/a14rmhgb","kind":"textbox","text":"检查人物和声音\n重新点击确认","position":{"left":672,"top":200,"width":235,"height":94}},{"id":"sh/xovqhcz2","kind":"textbox","text":"开始生成\n查看和下载结果","position":{"left":976,"top":200,"width":235,"height":94}},{"id":"sh/sby90zm1","kind":"textbox","text":"避免“内容已改，仍按旧安排生成”","position":{"left":64,"top":370,"width":1110,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/tc7at436","kind":"textbox","text":"重新拆分时，不能拿上一次的确认继续生成。\n同一本书的保存、确认和开始生成，程序会协调顺序，避免互相冲突。","position":{"left":64,"top":419,"width":1110,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/69gry94v","kind":"textbox","text":"关闭进度显示，也不会把仍在工作的任务误当成已经结束。","position":{"left":64,"top":548,"width":1140,"height":58}},{"id":"sh/rapsrelg","kind":"textbox","text":"后台流程已经测试，新控件在浏览器中的实际操作体验仍需最后确认","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}
{"id":"sl/7qto7e10","index":23,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"现在做到哪一步，接下来先做什么","elements":[{"id":"sh/9wzq1svi","kind":"textbox","text":"现在做到哪一步，接下来先做什么","position":{"left":64,"top":48,"width":1150,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/1sfqxsv6","kind":"textbox","text":"24","position":{"left":1173,"top":669,"width":45,"height":25}},{"id":"tb/dwfihcv6","kind":"table","text":"方面\t目前已经做了\t下一步\n整套制作流程\t选章节、分人物、选声音、生成和查问题\t先把 MiMo 网页使用流程做好\n实际使用\t完成首章生成，修过重复和长停顿等问题\t完成这一版整章试听，再扩大使用\n研究准备\t有修复案例，也有 36 道人物辨认题\t换更多书，找听众做比较\n其他语音服务\t原转换器支持多种服务\t新的适配与论文实验暂缓","position":{"left":64,"top":178,"width":1152,"height":347}},{"id":"sh/nux8zidc","kind":"textbox","text":"最近保存的程序测试：674 项，644 项通过，30 项因环境跳过。","position":{"left":64,"top":558,"width":1150,"height":53}},{"id":"sh/2to76dcr","kind":"textbox","text":"程序测试说明功能运行情况，实际听感和论文效果还需要另外验证","position":{"left":64,"top":636,"width":1090,"height":42}}]}